{"columns":["notice_id","section_id","field_id","v"],"row_count":29,"rows":[[46730362,"1","BT-24-Lot","NHS Frimley ICB (\"the Commissioner\") sought to commission provision to provide emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 years of age in North-East Hampshire and Farnham.\nYoung Person's Safe Haven will provide a safe, calm environment offering a holistic emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 y"],[46730362,"PROCEDURE","BT-21-Procedure","Emotional Well being and Mental Health Support Service"],[46730362,"PROCEDURE","BT-24-Procedure","NHS Frimley ICB (\"the Commissioner\") sought to commission provision to provide emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 years of age in North-East Hampshire and Farnham.\nYoung Person's Safe Haven will provide a safe, calm environment offering a holistic emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 y"],[46796184,"1","BT-24-Lot","NHS Frimley ICB (\"the Commissioner\") sought to commission provision to provide Emotional Wellbeing and Mental Health Support Services to children/young people aged 10 to 17 years of age in North-East Hampshire and Farnham.\nYoung Person's Safe Haven will provide a safe, calm environment offering a holistic emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 "],[46796184,"PROCEDURE","BT-21-Procedure","Young People's Safe Haven"],[46796184,"PROCEDURE","BT-24-Procedure","NHS Frimley ICB (\"the Commissioner\") sought to commission provision to provide Emotional Wellbeing and Mental Health Support Services to children/young people aged 10 to 17 years of age in North-East Hampshire and Farnham.\nYoung Person's Safe Haven will provide a safe, calm environment offering a holistic emotional wellbeing and mental health support service to children/young people aged 10 to 17 "],[46869506,"1","BT-24-Lot","NHS Hampshire and the Isle of Wight intend to commission No Limits to provide Emergency Department (ED) Youth Workers for the total lifetime value of £914,000 between 01 April 2025 and 31 March 2028.  Their core functions is to provide specialist youth work-based interventions, based on support needs at the time. The service equips young people with more skills and knowledge to look after and mana"],[46869506,"PROCEDURE","BT-21-Procedure","Youth Workers in Emergency Departments"],[46869506,"PROCEDURE","BT-24-Procedure","NHS Hampshire and the Isle of Wight intend to commission No Limits to provide Emergency Department (ED) Youth Workers.  Their core functions is to provide specialist youth work-based interventions, based on support needs at the time. The service equips young people with more skills and knowledge to look after and manage their mental health and address some of the wider personal and social factors "],[46910644,"1a","BT-21-Lot","Lot 1a Supported Living & Outreach (Learning Disabilities and Comparable Needs)"],[46910644,"1a","BT-24-Lot","Lot 1a Supported Living & Outreach (Learning Disabilities and Comparable Needs)"],[46910644,"1b","BT-21-Lot","Lot 1b Supported Living & Outreach (Mental Health and Comparable Needs)."],[46910644,"1b","BT-24-Lot","Lot 1b Supported Living & Outreach (Mental Health and Comparable Needs). Full details can be found within the procurement documents."],[46910644,"PROCEDURE","BT-21-Procedure","Inclusive Lives Framework Agreement: Part 1: Supported Living"],[46910644,"PROCEDURE","BT-24-Procedure","This procurement is for the establishment of a framework agreement (\"the Framework\") as a procurement vehicle for the commissioning and procurement by Southampton City Council (\"the Council\")  and the Hampshire & Isle of Wight Integrated Care Board (\"the ICB\") of social care supported living services under the Council's Inclusive Lives commissioning agenda. The procurement was conducted under the "],[46988113,"1","BT-21-Lot","1.\tCost Manager"],[46988113,"1","BT-24-Lot","Cost Management. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"2","BT-21-Lot","Project Manager (including ECC Project Manager)"],[46988113,"2","BT-24-Lot","Project Management. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"3","BT-21-Lot","Architect"],[46988113,"3","BT-24-Lot","Architect. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"4","BT-21-Lot","Civil and Structural Engineer"],[46988113,"4","BT-24-Lot","Civil and Structural Engineer. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"5","BT-21-Lot","Services Engineer"],[46988113,"5","BT-24-Lot","Services Engineer. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"6","BT-21-Lot","Building Surveyor"],[46988113,"6","BT-24-Lot","Building Surveyor. There will be value bands under this lot and bidders will be given the option to bid for any number of these value bands."],[46988113,"PROCEDURE","BT-21-Procedure","Construction Professional Services Framework"],[46988113,"PROCEDURE","BT-24-Procedure","The University requires the services of experienced and competent suppliers, as part of a Constructional Professional Services Framework for Consultants.\nTo obtain the Procurement documents you need to follow instructions below:\n1. Register as a supplier / login into the Intend Supplier portal using the URL provided.\n2. Go to 'Tenders' then select 'Current Tenders'\n3. Search for 'Construction Prof"]],"truncated":false}